---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Fastty Documentation">
  <Nav />
  <main class="docs-main">
    <div class="container docs-container">
      <aside class="docs-sidebar">
        <nav class="toc">
          <h4 class="mono">Contents</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#introduction">Introduction & Architecture</a></li>
            <li><a href="#installation">Installation & Setup</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cli-usage">CLI Usage & AI Integration</a></li>
            <li><a href="#core-features">Core Features</a></li>
            <li><a href="#configuration">Configuration Guide</a></li>
            <li><a href="#keybindings">Keyboard Shortcuts</a></li>
            <li><a href="#benchmarks">Benchmarks</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </aside>
      
      <article class="docs-content">
        <h1 class="section-title">Documentation</h1>
        
        <section id="introduction" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Introduction & Architecture</h2>
          <p>Built in Rust with GPUI (Zed's UI engine) & Alacritty Terminal parser. Low-level Paint API (<code>paint_quad</code>, <code>shape_line</code> with strict monospace cell advance <code>force_width</code>), zero hairline gaps geometric synthesis for block elements (U+2580..=U+259F) and box-drawing (U+2500..=U+257F).</p>
        </section>

        <section id="installation" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Installation & Setup</h2>
          <p>One-line curl for macOS, Linux, Windows PowerShell, and building from source with Rust/Cargo.</p>
          <div class="code-block">
            <pre><code>curl -sS https://fastty.dev/install.sh | sh</code></pre>
          </div>
          <h3>Build from source</h3>
          <div class="code-block">
            <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/diegoleteliers10/fasty.git
cd fasty
cargo build --release</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="cli-usage" class="docs-section">
          <h2>CLI Usage & AI Agent Integration</h2>
          <p>Complete CLI reference for <code>fastty [OPTIONS] [-- &lt;CMD&gt;...]</code>:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>-d, --dir, --working-directory &lt;DIR&gt;</code></li>
            <li><code>-t, --title &lt;TITLE&gt;</code></li>
            <li><code>-e, --exec, --command &lt;CMD...&gt;</code></li>
            <li><code>-- &lt;CMD...&gt;</code></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>AI Agent Integration Example</h3>
          <p>Practical examples for developers and AI coding agents:</p>
          <div class="code-block">
            <pre><code>fastty --title "Dev Server" -d ~/api -e bun run dev</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="core-features" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Core Features</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Command Palette:</strong> (<code>⌘⇧P</code> / <code>Ctrl+Shift+P</code>)</li>
            <li><strong>Project / Tab Jumper:</strong> (<code>⌘J</code> / <code>Ctrl+Shift+J</code>)</li>
            <li><strong>Git Worktree Switcher:</strong> (<code>⌘⌥W</code> / <code>Ctrl+Alt+W</code>)</li>
            <li><strong>SSH Host Manager:</strong> (<code>⌘O</code> / <code>Ctrl+Shift+O</code>)</li>
            <li><strong>In-buffer search:</strong> (<code>⌘F</code> / <code>Ctrl+F</code>) with instant regex and match navigation</li>
            <li><strong>Smart Token / Link Classifier:</strong> (URLs, file paths, hex colors with click-to-open)</li>
            <li><strong>Native Tab Tear-Out & Multi-Window:</strong> with full live state / scrollback preservation</li>
            <li><strong>Synchronized Output:</strong> (DEC Mode 2026) for flicker-free TUI rendering</li>
            <li><strong>Full IME support:</strong> (dead keys, Latam, Japanese/Chinese composition)</li>
            <li><strong>Live Theme Switcher:</strong> with 5 built-in palettes & custom theme JSON drop-in</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="configuration" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Configuration Guide</h2>
          <p><code>~/.config/fastty/config.toml</code> complete schema explanation with code snippets (font family, font size, opacity, padding, scrollback, themes, keybindings).</p>
          <div class="code-block">
            <pre><code>[window]
padding = &#123; x = 12, y = 12 &#125;
opacity = 0.95

[font]
family = "JetBrains Mono"
size = 14

[terminal]
scrollback = 10000

[theme]
name = "voltage"</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="keybindings" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Keyboard Shortcuts Reference Cheat Sheet</h2>
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Action</th>
                <th>macOS</th>
                <th>Linux / Windows</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Command Palette</td>
                <td><code>⌘⇧P</code></td>
                <td><code>Ctrl+Shift+P</code></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Project / Tab Jumper</td>
                <td><code>⌘J</code></td>
                <td><code>Ctrl+Shift+J</code></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Git Worktree Switcher</td>
                <td><code>⌘⌥W</code></td>
                <td><code>Ctrl+Alt+W</code></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>SSH Host Manager</td>
                <td><code>⌘O</code></td>
                <td><code>Ctrl+Shift+O</code></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>In-buffer search</td>
                <td><code>⌘F</code></td>
                <td><code>Ctrl+F</code></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section id="benchmarks" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Benchmarks</h2>
          <p>Criterion parser bench numbers on Apple Silicon M5:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Plain text: <strong>23.9 µs</strong></li>
            <li>SGR ANSI: <strong>40.9 µs</strong></li>
            <li>Complex: <strong>23.5 µs</strong></li>
            <li>Idle CPU: <strong>&lt;0.7%</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .docs-main {
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }
  
  .docs-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }
  
  .docs-sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
    padding-right: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .toc h4 {
    color: var(--voltage-orange);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .toc ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .toc a {
    color: var(--voltage-text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: color 150ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .toc a:hover {
    color: var(--voltage-orange);
  }

  .docs-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  .docs-content h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .docs-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .docs-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .docs-section h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .docs-section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--voltage-text-subtle);
  }

  .docs-section ul {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--voltage-text-subtle);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .docs-section li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .docs-section strong {
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
  }

  .docs-section code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--voltage-overlay);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--voltage-line);
    color: var(--voltage-orange);
  }

  .code-block {
    background: var(--voltage-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--voltage-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .code-block pre {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .code-block code {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--voltage-panel);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  th, td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--voltage-line);
  }

  th {
    color: var(--voltage-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: var(--voltage-overlay);
  }

  td {
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  
  td code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--voltage-line);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--voltage-orange);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .docs-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .docs-sidebar {
      position: static;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--voltage-line);
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
